{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37866","headline":"府试莱城晴日望三山 · 许彬","name":"府试莱城晴日望三山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不易识蓬瀛，凭高望有程。\n盘根出巨浸，远色到孤城。\n隐隐排云峻，层层就日明。\n净收残霭尽，浮动嫩岚轻。\n纵目徒多暇，驰心累发诚。\n从容更何往，此路彻三清。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许彬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37866.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37866","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}